        "Alias": "ldcrm",
        "ConnectionStringEncrypted": "9Gxx68YLS83hR9Wl6iV1n8JudaNhT1m8YhWxkGMltS/CYI3KTV3z8EZMoZjiXGJejW5zg+8PuplyBpzMYow1Z4tgf0NJCVpZ4X2gvWQId0bjXE8K10FL3WIZ/YTq"
      }
    }
  },
